# Sitemap Generator - Sitemaps Directory
This directory stores generated sitemap files.

Each project will have its own subdirectory with the sitemap files:
- `{project-slug}/sitemap-index.xml` - The sitemap index file
- `{project-slug}/sitemap-1.xml` - First sitemap file (up to 50,000 URLs)
- `{project-slug}/sitemap-2.xml` - Second sitemap file (if needed)
- etc.

**Note:** Do not manually edit these files. They are auto-generated.
